            "level": {
              "value": 2
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "The more people you have looking at you, the more content you are, and you take every opportunity to show up others when their performances are less than perfect. You gain the Upstage reaction. In addition, when you Earn Income, if the level of the task is higher than your level, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your check to Earn Income.\n\n**Upstage [reaction]**\nTrigger: A foe attempts a skill check and doesn't get a critical success\nAfter your foe has tried their best, you show everyone how it's really done. Attempt a check using the same skill that triggered this reaction.\nCritical Success: You gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks until the end of your next turn.\nSuccess: As critical success, except you gain the benefits only if the triggering creature failed their skill check."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
